{"candidateAnswer":"Game mods, football simulator, strategy game, first game, Unity strategy game","evidence":"[D13:7 | 4:30 pm on 13 June, 2022] John: Cool! That sounds awesome. Combining your love of gaming and coding sounds like a dream. Tell me more! Are there any interesting projects you're working on?\n[D1:4 | 3:47 pm on 17 March, 2022] James: I'm totally into The Witcher 3 right now. The story and atmosphere are amazing. Have you tried it yet?\n[D27:2 | 2:14 pm on 13 October, 2022] James: Hey John, congrats! Something cool happened to me recently. I made my first game and released it for the gaming community - it was so exciting!","itemId":"urn:uuid:4522dedb-f7b1-5236-816f-095603ffca18","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:d2341e48568ba22ad50151b0e5ddee4b608c5c5e2ede78157215831e8bf54927","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What kind of games has James tried to develop?","referenceAnswer":"football simulator, virtual world inspired by Witcher 3","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"d2341e48568ba22ad50151b0e5ddee4b608c5c5e2ede78157215831e8bf54927"}}]}